    owl:sameAs <https://w3id.org/idsa/code/YI> .

<http://dbpedia.org/resource/ISO_639:yo> a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    owl:sameAs <https://w3id.org/idsa/code/YO> .

<http://dbpedia.org/resource/ISO_639:za> a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    owl:sameAs <https://w3id.org/idsa/code/ZA> .

